      "snippet": {
        "line": 404,
        "text": "logWeight cL cR a b m X = Real.exp (-cL / (Real.log (X / a)) ^ 2 - cR / (Real.log (b / X)) ^ 2) / (min 1 (min (Real.log (X / a)) (Real.log (b / X)))) ^ m   (for 0 < a, X ∈ Ioo a b)"
      }
